      "name": "Alok kanodia",
      "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:37:40.057Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello</p>\n<p>I am using ERPNEXT<br>\nI have same item from multiple brands.<br>\nNeed to have 1 item from many brand and store stock brand wise.<br>\nSo everytime I have a Stock entry , Need to select the brand.</p>\n<p>Is it possible in ERPNEXT ?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/alokkanodia/{size}/37354_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
