      "id": 476512,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-06T11:06:15.671Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/alokkanodia\">@alokkanodia</a></p>\n<p>This is very much possible in ERPNext.</p>\n<p>If you configure Brand as Inventory Dimension, then one item within item master can handle multiple brands at a time. The stock ledger and Balance report will offer stock statuses based on brand then.</p>\n<p>Please refer to the documentation as well;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/inventory_dimension\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/inventory_dimension</a></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e47774/{size}.png",
