      "id": 476564,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2025-08-06T21:12:02.386Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>You should follow through;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>create your custom brand doctype</li>\n<li>make it inventory dimension</li>\n<li>tag it on each stock transaction like purchase receipt or delivery note.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>then you will have stock reports as per brand even though you have used same item.</p>",
